## Folder guide

- `approval/` — travel requests and approvals
- `funding/` — funding applications and confirmations
- `transport/` — flights, trains, and local transfers
- `accommodation/` — hotel and other accommodation
- `registration/` — conference registration and memberships
- `receipts/` — invoices and proof of payment
- `reimbursement/` — expense claims and payment confirmations

See [checklist.md](checklist.md) for trip tasks, [itinerary.md](itinerary.md) for the schedule, and [expenses.csv](expenses.csv) for expense tracking.
